16
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:31.380
hundred, and thirty and one

17
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.820
hundred twenty. Their densities are

18
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.840
six, five and four, so

19
00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.300
