20
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.140
the same as in the

21
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:38.940
fractional lesson.

22
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.380
Take item one fully, using

23
00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:43.140
ten weight and earning sixty.

24
00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:46.080
Item two also fits, so

25
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.820
take it, bringing the totals

26
00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:49.880
