28
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.440
The remaining capacity is twenty,

29
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.600
but item three weighs thirty

30
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.740
and cannot be divided. Skip

31
00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.100
