74
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:24.500
Sorting takes order n times

75
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.460
the logarithm of n, followed

76
00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:27.980
by a linear scan through

77
00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.060
the items. The exact dynamic

78
00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:31.700
program uses a table with

79
00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.420
n item choices and C

80
00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.880
capacity values, giving order n

81
00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.680
